[1m[38;5;231mWhich tooling should the design set up from the start?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [ ] [38;5;153mLint + format (Recommended)[39m
  [38;5;246mESLint + Prettier with the standard JS config, plus npm scripts. Catches errors early and keeps style consistent as [39m
  [38;5;246mmore forms are added.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Unit tests (Recommended)
  [38;5;246mA test runner (node:test or Vitest) with a first passing test for the visitor-ID module: generates once, persists, [39m
  [38;5;246mrecovers from corrupt storage.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Static server script
  [38;5;246mAn npm start using a static server, required for ES modules to load (type="module" won't work over file://).[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright driving a real browser through the login form. Thorough, but heavy infrastructure for a stubbed login.[39m
